            <h2 class="section-title">Our Mission</h2>
            <div class="about-content">
                <div class="about-text">
                    <p>
                        The Women in Cybersecurity (WiCyS) Chapter here at Oregon State University focuses on the educational and professional development of underrepresented groups in the field of cybersecurity. Our goal is to provide a warm, welcoming, and empowering space where you can feel comfortable learning (and have fun while you do so)!
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Meeting Types Section -->
    <section class="about-section">
